{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgS3pSLUwYQtBjtbnXCKt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The cache fix is in `bot.py`, and the write-up is in `ANSWER.md`. I haven't been able to confirm the caching itself works, because the static prefix may be too short to cache at all.\n\n**Cause:** `build_system` put the static instructions and the per-athlete context (facts, zones, date) in one cached block. Each `save_fact` changed that block, so the next call missed the cache and paid for it again.\n\n**Change:** The system prompt is now two blocks.\n1. The static `INSTRUCTIONS`, with the `cache_control` marker. This is identical for every athlete and every day.\n2. The athlete context, with no marker, after the breakpoint. A fact change now only touches this tail.\n\nI checked this by calling `build_system` directly, without touching `data/athletes.json`. The cached block is identical after a `save_fact`, across athletes, and across dates.\n\n**Open risk:** Caching is skipped silently when the cached prefix is under the model's minimum (about 1024 tokens). The tools plus instructions are probably around 800–900 tokens. I couldn't check this because I have no API key and didn't want to send anything externally. After deploying, look at the first two calls for one athlete in `logs/usage.jsonl`. You should see `cache_creation_input_tokens` > 0 on the first call and `cache_read_input_tokens` > 0 on the next, even after a `save_fact`. If both stay at 0, the prefix needs to be longer. That is a product decision, so I didn't pad it.\n\n**Not changed:** Keyword-gated tool selection also changes part of the cache prefix, so a message that triggers the plan or race tools still misses the cache. NOTES.md calls that filter a win, so I left it alone.\n\nThe changes are uncommitted on `main`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1359,"cache_read_input_tokens":35160,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1359},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1e465283-ddbe-4b71-8229-365c3bba8764","uuid":"de1486ff-c61e-44b3-9cef-d1939f9a823d","timestamp":"2026-10-27T03:41:44.822Z","request_id":"req_011CgS3pS482JeUVhvYELYS9"}
